    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/b6475d937b4353b16e91bfe0f9ddfaea.poster.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/b6475d937b4353b16e91bfe0f9ddfaea.webm?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/b6475d937b4353b16e91bfe0f9ddfaea.mp4?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>2080, Japan. Neo-Yokohama is a chaotic, violent hellhole.<br>With the police nowhere to be seen and crime hiding itself in every corner, <br>citizens are permitted to bear arms for self-defense.<br>The town is well and truly a final refuge for those with nowhere else left to go.<br><br>It's in this neon town that a lone girl named Kanon lurks the streets, ready for battle.<br>She's on a mission to track down and put an end to Elysion,<br>the drug that has embedded itself deep into the dirty fabric of Neo Yokohama.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/259f805ccbd5d9b11c5e5c2f47d4d01b.poster.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/259f805ccbd5d9b11c5e5c2f47d4d01b.webm?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/259f805ccbd5d9b11c5e5c2f47d4d01b.mp4?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game has full Japanese voice acting!<br></li><li>All CGs and character illustrations are fully animated!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/972492d60c7df2189ea9c1becf7ffe85.poster.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/972492d60c7df2189ea9c1becf7ffe85.webm?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/972492d60c7df2189ea9c1becf7ffe85.mp4?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/dc9dbfb9cd7bb34bd270fc0e9bb212f0.poster.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/dc9dbfb9cd7bb34bd270fc0e9bb212f0.webm?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/dc9dbfb9cd7bb34bd270fc0e9bb212f0.mp4?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Dead-End City Blues is an RPG based around card battles.<br>You will receive random cards to strengthen your deck and take on your male foes.<br>Lose, however, and Kanon will be violated.<br>Lose enough times, and you'll receive the bad ending.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/e83968f6f567ebee408b25a8eb1242e8.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=340 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/077b30211053d785dd982921a8fa4ea4.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=340 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/48f49dd57b452a8164a6c8e4b97906c5.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=340 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>11 base CGs<br></li><li>21 sex scenes.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/0fd112748f847e45f26e21dc05cbc69c.poster.avif?t=1732176672\" width=616 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/0fd112748f847e45f26e21dc05cbc69c.webm?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756380/extras/0fd112748f847e45f26e21dc05cbc69c.mp4?t=1732176672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
